          "text": "So the answer is fourteen x minus seven.",
          "display": "= 14x − 7",
          "cue": "answer"
        },
        {
          "id": "b05",
          "text": "Watch out for these traps. If you multiply only the two x, you get fourteen x minus one. If you add seven and two, you get nine x minus seven.",
